OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'hidden gem' offering a place
OL,4,Ato grow, connect and heal
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom a lifeless strip of grass to a
OL,7,Fblossoming garden, Annadale Community
OL,8,FCentre's grounds have received a glow
OL,9,Fup over the past year, becoming a
OL,10,F"hidden gem" for all to enjoy.
OL,12,FThe volunteer group has now been
OL,13,Frecognised for its contribution to the
OL,14,Flocal area, receiving a nomination for
OL,15,Fthe BBC Make a Difference Awards.
OL,17,FAnnadale Community Centre Gardening
OL,18,FGroup meets every Tuesday and will
OL,19,Fcelebrate its first birthday in
OL,20,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
